OL,3,AAre California voters about to impose
OL,4,A'world's first' tax on billionaires?
OL,5,
OL,6,FFew places on the planet have as many
OL,7,Fultra-wealthy residents as California,
OL,8,Fa US state known for glamour, coastal
OL,9,Fmega-mansions, and being home to the
OL,10,Frich and famous.
OL,12,FNow voters are about to decide whether
OL,13,Fthe mega-rich among them - including
OL,14,Fmedia mogul Oprah Winfrey, Meta head
OL,15,FMark Zuckerberg, Skims cofounder and
OL,16,Freality television star Kim Kardashian,
OL,17,Fand filmmaker George Lucas - should
OL,18,Fhand over billions of dollars to pay
OL,19,Ffor improvements to healthcare.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
