OL,3,AAre California voters about to impose
OL,4,A'world's first' tax on billionaires?
OL,5,
OL,6,FProposition 40 is aimed at levying a
OL,7,Fone-time 5% tax on the net worth of all
OL,8,Fof California's billionaires.
OL,10,FThere are a little more than 200 such
OL,11,Findividuals in the state - but that
OL,12,Fhasn't stopped the measure from
OL,13,Fdividing leaders and causing some of
OL,14,Fits ultra-wealthy residents to flee.
OL,15,FOne billionaire businessman says he's
OL,16,Fbrought jobs to California, but the
OL,17,Fproposition made him feel "a little bit
OL,18,Flike I wasn't wanted".
